# What never gets uploaded to Vercel.
#
# Production runs DATA_PROVIDER=supabase and reads its config from the Vercel project's
# environment variables, so the local SQLite database and the local .env stay here.
#
# NOTE: `data/` itself is deliberately NOT ignored — data/store.js is the app's data
# layer (and data/db.js is its lazily-imported SQLite half), so excluding the folder
# would break the build. Only the database files and generated previews are dropped.
*.db*
data/previews/

# Local-only tooling: nothing in the dashboard's import graph touches these.
secrets/
builder/
mailer/
host/

*.tar.gz
.env
.env.*
